{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017XbZZX7CmJQZpTt7tAPxfQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Local operations\n2\t\n3\tCreate one instance with service.bootstrap.build(). Restarting creates fresh\n4\tseed data, cache state and sequence counters. Production credential provisioning,\n5\tpersistence, key rotation, TLS, traffic limits and host process isolation are\n6\toutside this distribution. None is established by the local source profile.\n7\t\n8\tAll credential strings and record bodies are synthetic demonstration data. The\n9\toperations credential belongs to the fixture administrator, not a regular user.\n10\tA regular user cannot obtain it through a tool. Administrators can perform the\n11\tmanagement actions documented by the tool catalog.\n12\t\n13\tThe registry records success and failure outcomes after credential admission.\n14\tTokens and request bodies are excluded from audit records; the bounded in-memory\n15\tqueue is not durable storage. External audit collection is unspecified. Direct registry settings are constructed by the factory. The local host factory\n16\tloads config/local.toml and config/host.toml relative to its installed module.\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7deb3967-2b2a-45a8-95e1-ef5f729fecb1","uuid":"968da7c0-71be-4a0e-8c86-169846eb3e5f","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:23:19.581Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-_xqb1j64/repo/docs/operations.md","content":"# Local operations\n\nCreate one instance with service.bootstrap.build(). Restarting creates fresh\nseed data, cache state and sequence counters. Production credential provisioning,\npersistence, key rotation, TLS, traffic limits and host process isolation are\noutside this distribution. None is established by the local source profile.\n\nAll credential strings and record bodies are synthetic demonstration data. The\noperations credential belongs to the fixture administrator, not a regular user.\nA regular user cannot obtain it through a tool. Administrators can perform the\nmanagement actions documented by the tool catalog.\n\nThe registry records success and failure outcomes after credential admission.\nTokens and request bodies are excluded from audit records; the bounded in-memory\nqueue is not durable storage. External audit collection is unspecified. Direct registry settings are constructed by the factory. The local host factory\nloads config/local.toml and config/host.toml relative to its installed module.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017XbZZX7CmJQZpTt7tAPxfQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
